[[576,7,4096,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The supply for fan \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N11</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               arrives directly\nfrom the battery from the line for the VENT maxifuse of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B6</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               up\nto 2/99 or FAN 1 of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               from 2/99: the fan therefore works\nwhen it receives an earth command.</p><p>The relays \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J31</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , specific\nto the cooling system, receive a supply at their coils controlled\nby the ignition (15/54) protected by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B25</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               up to 2/99\nor fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the additional fuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98A</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               from 2/99.</p><p>They are energized by an earth signal coming\nfrom the engine control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>If the engine coolant reaches a first temperature\nlevel, the control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends (from pin 23 of connector\nB) an earth signal to the fan 1st speed relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               which energizes\nthe coil. The relay then sends an earth signal which, via the additional\nresistor \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>O10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , operates the fan \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N11</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               which rotates at\nthe first (slow) speed.</p><p>If the engine coolant reaches a higher temperature,\nthe control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends (from 45 of connector C) an earth\nsignal to the fan 2nd speed relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J31</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               which energizes the\ncoil. The relay then sends an earth signal directly to the fan \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N11</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               which\nrotates at the maximum speed.</p>"]]